.TH MUNLOCKALL 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
munlockall \- unlocks the calling process's locked pages
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/mman.h>
.B int munlockall(void);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Unlocks the calling process's locked pages.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR munlockall (2)
